# fields-next — шаги записи (что показывается — fields-next.md)
# Его замечание 2026-10-05 к fields-2: команды Field next/previous против tagWheel — отдельный GIF.
# next/previous меняют Value одной клавишей вслепую; tagWheel показывает все Values в Scroller.
title Fields: next, previous or tagWheel | Step a Field with one key, or see all its Values first
drop Priority
drop Due
drop Project
preset visual.tagWheel.scroller.enabled = true
open Task fields.md
line-width 480
caret - call the bank
stage Status next and previous
say Status next → the next Value, one key, no panel
cmd status-next
expect - #todo || call the bank
cmd status-next
expect - #doing || call the bank
say Status previous → one step back
cmd status-previous
expect - #todo || call the bank
stage tagWheel
say tagWheel → all Values of Status at once
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key ArrowUp
key ArrowUp
expect - #todo ==**[#done]**== || call the bank
say Enter → the one you picked
key Enter
expect - book a table / - #done || call the bank
